*.local

# Local secrets. `*.local` above already covers .env.local, which is where the
# VAPID public key goes; this covers the plain .env some tooling writes instead.
# The VAPID PRIVATE key must never be in either — it lives only as a Supabase
# function secret. See supabase/functions/send-reminders/README.md.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.claude/settings.local.json

